</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/14d43ae8-cee7-11eb-a46e-005056bf87d6/w:1024/p:16x9/KIJUXNGEUFF25HB5RRK42F5RMY.png"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/14d43ae8-cee7-11eb-a46e-005056bf87d6/w:1024/p:16x9/KIJUXNGEUFF25HB5RRK42F5RMY.png" type="image/png" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">915f2e34-7855-11f1-b9fa-610b43557c2b</guid><pubDate>Sun, 05 Jul 2026 10:49:51 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>夏榕</dc:creator></item><item><category>中国</category><title>中国释放北京锡安教会创办人 金明日牧师：“获释是中美两国元首讨论的结果”</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD/20260705-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E9%87%8A%E6%94%BE%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E9%94%A1%E5%AE%89%E6%95%99%E4%BC%9A%E5%88%9B%E5%8A%9E%E4%BA%BA-%E9%87%91%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E7%89%A7%E5%B8%88-%E8%8E%B7%E9%87%8A%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%AD%E7%BE%8E%E4%B8%A4%E5%9B%BD%E5%85%83%E9%A6%96%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C</link><description>
