</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/a7af9628-7829-11f1-b461-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/000-1913Z3.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/a7af9628-7829-11f1-b461-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/000-1913Z3.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">3cf319a4-784c-11f1-9409-fd20aabbb926</guid><pubDate>Sun, 05 Jul 2026 08:43:18 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/a7af9628-7829-11f1-b461-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/000-1913Z3.jpg">AFP - FRED DUFOUR</source><dc:creator>夏榕</dc:creator></item><item><category>中国</category><title>中方否认贸易失衡责任及援俄指控　丹麦外长呼吁欧盟协调对华政策</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD/20260704-%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%B9%E5%90%A6%E8%AE%A4%E8%B4%B8%E6%98%93%E5%A4%B1%E8%A1%A1%E8%B4%A3%E4%BB%BB%E5%8F%8A%E6%8F%B4%E4%BF%84%E6%8C%87%E6%8E%A7-%E4%B8%B9%E9%BA%A6%E5%A4%96%E9%95%BF%E5%91%BC%E5%90%81%E6%AC%A7%E7%9B%9F%E5%8D%8F%E8%B0%83%E5%AF%B9%E5%8D%8E%E6%94%BF%E7%AD%96</link><description>
